[{"text": "Hello, English learners, and welcome back to another episode of EnglishPod.", "start": 1.2000000000000004, "end": 5.44}, {"text": "My name is Marco.", "start": 5.52, "end": 6.26}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 6.52, "end": 7.32}, {"text": "And today, with Erika, we are getting married.", "start": 7.72, "end": 10.76}, {"text": "Well, we're not getting married.", "start": 11.14, "end": 13.06}, {"text": "We're not, but our actors in the podcast are.", "start": 13.82, "end": 16.98}, {"text": "That's right.", "start": 17.16, "end": 17.7}, {"text": "So we've got a lesson today about weddings.", "start": 17.78, "end": 20.94}, {"text": "And you know what?", "start": 21.8, "end": 22.86}, {"text": "A lot of the language in this lesson is about weddings and marriages.", "start": 22.98, "end": 28.36}, {"text": "And maybe you don't need to use this language every day.", "start": 28.36, "end": 32.66}, {"text": "But learning this vocabulary will definitely help you understand or learn a lot more about Anglo culture.", "start": 33.26, "end": 40.06}, {"text": "Okay, great point, Marco.", "start": 40.28, "end": 41.3}, {"text": "I think now we can look at our vocabulary preview.", "start": 41.6, "end": 44.58}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 45.7, "end": 47.02}, {"text": "So two simple words in this vocabulary preview.", "start": 47.54, "end": 50.86}, {"text": "The first one is groom.", "start": 51.36, "end": 53.66}, {"text": "Groom.", "start": 54.34, "end": 55.0}, {"text": "Groom.", "start": 55.32, "end": 56.0}, {"text": "Groom.", "start": 56.36, "end": 57.0}, {"text": "So who is the groom?", "start": 57.0, "end": 58.98}, {"text": "Is the man.", "start": 59.36, "end": 60.38}, {"text": "The man that's getting married.", "start": 60.52, "end": 61.68}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 61.86, "end": 62.1}, {"text": "And our second word is?", "start": 62.1, "end": 64.3}, {"text": "Bride.", "start": 64.74, "end": 65.38}, {"text": "Bride.", "start": 65.7, "end": 66.34}, {"text": "Bride.", "start": 66.66, "end": 67.3}, {"text": "And obviously the bride is?", "start": 67.52, "end": 69.3}, {"text": "The woman getting married.", "start": 69.48, "end": 70.74}, {"text": "Perfect.", "start": 70.92, "end": 71.22}, {"text": "Now we have our bride and our groom.", "start": 71.54, "end": 73.74}, {"text": "So it's time to listen to our dialogue the first time.", "start": 73.74, "end": 77.4}, {"text": "I can't believe that Anthony is finally getting married.", "start": 88.80000000000001, "end": 91.6}, {"text": "Yeah, well, it's about time.", "start": 91.94, "end": 93.24}, {"text": "He's been living with his parents for 40 years.", "start": 93.42, "end": 95.42}, {"text": "Don't be mean.", "start": 95.6, "end": 96.58}, {"text": "Look, here come the bridesmaids.", "start": 97.98, "end": 99.52}, {"text": "Oh, their dresses look beautiful.", "start": 99.68, "end": 101.16}, {"text": "Who are those kids walking down the aisle?", "start": 101.76, "end": 103.32}, {"text": "That's the flower girl and the rain bearer.", "start": 103.32, "end": 105.9}, {"text": "I'm pretty sure that they're the groom's niece and nephew.", "start": 106.3, "end": 108.44}, {"text": "Oh, they look so cute.", "start": 108.68, "end": 110.28}, {"text": "I just hope the priest makes it quick.", "start": 110.62, "end": 112.34}, {"text": "I'm starving.", "start": 112.5, "end": 113.14}, {"text": "I hope the food's good at the reception.", "start": 113.44, "end": 115.1}, {"text": "That's all you ever think about.", "start": 115.54, "end": 117.06}, {"text": "Food.", "start": 117.22, "end": 117.64}, {"text": "Oh, I think the bride's coming now.", "start": 118.8, "end": 120.54}, {"text": "Oh, she looks gorgeous.", "start": 120.72, "end": 122.04}, {"text": "Wait.", "start": 124.74000000000001, "end": 125.18}, {"text": "What's she doing?", "start": 125.54, "end": 126.32}, {"text": "Where is she going?", "start": 126.62, "end": 127.62}, {"text": "So great.", "start": 127.62, "end": 128.82}, {"text": "Does this mean the reception is canceled?", "start": 129.18, "end": 130.84}, {"text": "Oh, Marco, that's so sad.", "start": 135.6, "end": 137.78}, {"text": "Yeah, I know.", "start": 138.46, "end": 139.28}, {"text": "The reception is canceled.", "start": 139.48, "end": 140.92}, {"text": "Marco, they're not getting married.", "start": 141.0, "end": 143.58}, {"text": "Oh, well, I mean, the best part is when you go and eat and drink at the reception.", "start": 144.04, "end": 148.18}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 148.54, "end": 148.8}, {"text": "Well, there's some great language in this dialogue.", "start": 149.56, "end": 151.92}, {"text": "And now let's look at our language takeaway.", "start": 151.92, "end": 155.9}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 157.62, "end": 158.68}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 159.64000000000001, "end": 160.4}, {"text": "Our first word on the language takeaway today is it's about time.", "start": 160.58, "end": 164.82}, {"text": "It's about time.", "start": 165.12, "end": 167.14}, {"text": "It's about time.", "start": 167.52, "end": 168.78}, {"text": "It's about time.", "start": 169.06, "end": 169.8}, {"text": "So now we are going to listen to some examples on how we use this great phrase.", "start": 170.1, "end": 176.48}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 177.52, "end": 178.66}, {"text": "Dinner's ready.", "start": 181.3, "end": 182.28}, {"text": "It's about time.", "start": 182.66, "end": 183.68}, {"text": "I'm starving.", "start": 183.86, "end": 184.56}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 187.94, "end": 188.82}, {"text": "Guess what?", "start": 192.14, "end": 192.94}, {"text": "I finally got a job.", "start": 193.14, "end": 194.3}, {"text": "It's about time.", "start": 194.64, "end": 195.44}, {"text": "You've been unemployed for two years.", "start": 195.44, "end": 197.42}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 202.02, "end": 202.96}, {"text": "We're almost there.", "start": 206.8, "end": 207.82}, {"text": "Just a couple more minutes.", "start": 208.04, "end": 208.9}, {"text": "It's about time.", "start": 209.14, "end": 210.06}, {"text": "We've been driving for 12 hours.", "start": 210.28, "end": 212.58}, {"text": "So this phrase means finally.", "start": 215.06, "end": 218.2}, {"text": "Finally.", "start": 218.56, "end": 219.04}, {"text": "At last.", "start": 219.4, "end": 220.08}, {"text": "We've been waiting a long time for this.", "start": 220.28, "end": 222.52}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 222.76, "end": 223.26}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 223.7, "end": 223.9}, {"text": "So it's about time.", "start": 223.9, "end": 225.84}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 226.18, "end": 226.58}, {"text": "Let's take a look at our second word now.", "start": 226.76, "end": 228.54}, {"text": "Aisle.", "start": 229.48, "end": 229.92}, {"text": "Aisle.", "start": 233.3, "end": 233.98}, {"text": "Aisle.", "start": 235.04, "end": 235.6}, {"text": "Aisle.", "start": 235.72, "end": 236.18}, {"text": "It's a tricky word.", "start": 236.4, "end": 237.44}, {"text": "It sounds like the contraction of I will.", "start": 237.44, "end": 240.26}, {"text": "Yeah, but it's spelled so strangely.", "start": 240.62, "end": 242.88}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 243.36, "end": 243.64}, {"text": "We don't pronounce the S.", "start": 243.86, "end": 245.32}, {"text": "The S is silent.", "start": 245.42, "end": 246.28}, {"text": "That's true.", "start": 246.54, "end": 246.9}, {"text": "Aisle.", "start": 247.2, "end": 247.58}, {"text": "So what is an aisle?", "start": 248.16, "end": 249.28}, {"text": "In a big room where you have a lot of chairs, that space in the middle that allows people to", "start": 249.78, "end": 255.98}, {"text": "walk through, that's the aisle.", "start": 255.98, "end": 257.94}, {"text": "So the aisle is the part where you walk.", "start": 257.94, "end": 260.64}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 260.8, "end": 261.14}, {"text": "In a big room.", "start": 261.24, "end": 261.88}, {"text": "In a big room.", "start": 262.0, "end": 262.7}, {"text": "With many chairs.", "start": 262.8, "end": 263.42}, {"text": "With many chairs.", "start": 263.64, "end": 264.28}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 264.48, "end": 264.84}, {"text": "So in the church.", "start": 265.68000000000006, "end": 266.96}, {"text": "The bride and groom.", "start": 267.14, "end": 268.26}, {"text": "Walk down the aisle.", "start": 268.64, "end": 269.74}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 269.92, "end": 270.32}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 270.78, "end": 270.98}, {"text": "Let's move to our third word.", "start": 270.98, "end": 272.68}, {"text": "Bridesmaid.", "start": 273.78000000000003, "end": 274.18}, {"text": "Bridesmaid.", "start": 275.40000000000003, "end": 275.8}, {"text": "Bridesmaid.", "start": 277.22, "end": 277.62}, {"text": "So who are the bridesmaids?", "start": 277.76, "end": 279.04}, {"text": "Or wait, maybe you should ask me that.", "start": 279.14, "end": 280.58}, {"text": "Yeah, because we don't get bridesmaids.", "start": 281.08000000000004, "end": 283.74}, {"text": "Okay, so the bridesmaids are the women who are friends of the bride who stand next to", "start": 283.74, "end": 290.56}, {"text": "her when she's getting married.", "start": 290.56, "end": 291.78}, {"text": "Usually they're her best friends.", "start": 291.78, "end": 293.64}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 294.02, "end": 294.58}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 294.8, "end": 295.06}, {"text": "Okay, so we have our bridesmaids.", "start": 295.58, "end": 297.7}, {"text": "Now we have our flower girl.", "start": 297.7, "end": 300.7}, {"text": "Flower girl.", "start": 300.9, "end": 301.86}, {"text": "Flower girl.", "start": 302.14, "end": 303.3}, {"text": "Again, I'll explain this one.", "start": 303.74, "end": 305.58}, {"text": "Please, please.", "start": 305.7, "end": 306.12}, {"text": "The flower girl is that cute little girl who walks down the aisle and who throws flowers.", "start": 306.12, "end": 314.8}, {"text": "That's the flower girl.", "start": 315.14, "end": 316.58}, {"text": "And with the flower girl, we have our ring bearer.", "start": 316.72, "end": 321.34}, {"text": "Ring bearer.", "start": 321.52, "end": 323.32}, {"text": "Ring bearer.", "start": 323.7, "end": 324.98}, {"text": "So the ring bearer is the cute little boy who walks down the aisle carrying the...", "start": 325.3, "end": 331.82}, {"text": "Rings.", "start": 331.82, "end": 332.3}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 332.54, "end": 332.74}, {"text": "Okay, so a lot of useful vocabulary for a wedding ceremony.", "start": 332.74, "end": 337.12}, {"text": "That's true.", "start": 337.34, "end": 338.26}, {"text": "Now let's look at our last word.", "start": 338.58, "end": 340.24}, {"text": "Gorgeous.", "start": 340.8, "end": 341.36}, {"text": "Gorgeous.", "start": 341.86, "end": 342.42}, {"text": "Gorgeous.", "start": 343.4, "end": 343.96}, {"text": "Gorgeous means beautiful.", "start": 344.26, "end": 346.7}, {"text": "Very beautiful.", "start": 347.04, "end": 347.76}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 347.98, "end": 348.1}, {"text": "You know, beautiful you can only use with a woman.", "start": 348.52, "end": 351.22}, {"text": "Can you use gorgeous with a woman or with a man?", "start": 351.58, "end": 354.54}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 354.76, "end": 355.14}, {"text": "Gorgeous is unisex.", "start": 355.4, "end": 356.66}, {"text": "So both men and women are gorgeous.", "start": 356.9, "end": 359.14}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 359.32, "end": 359.48}, {"text": "You can say, oh, that girl is gorgeous.", "start": 359.54, "end": 362.0}, {"text": "That guy is gorgeous.", "start": 362.0, "end": 364.1}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 364.52, "end": 364.66}, {"text": "Or you can say even this house is gorgeous.", "start": 364.86, "end": 368.02}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 368.4, "end": 368.62}, {"text": "So men, women, objects.", "start": 368.82, "end": 370.34}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 370.64, "end": 370.88}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 371.0, "end": 371.14}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 371.68, "end": 372.14}, {"text": "Well, we've learned some really interesting vocabulary that will help us to understand", "start": 372.24, "end": 377.9}, {"text": "an Anglo wedding.", "start": 377.9, "end": 379.48}, {"text": "So why don't we listen to the dialogue slowed down?", "start": 379.48, "end": 383.24}, {"text": "I can't believe that Anthony is finally getting married.", "start": 388.7, "end": 393.9}, {"text": "Yeah, well, it's about time.", "start": 394.3, "end": 396.52}, {"text": "He's been living with his parents for 40 years.", "start": 396.78, "end": 400.68}, {"text": "Don't be mean.", "start": 400.68, "end": 402.4}, {"text": "Look.", "start": 402.72, "end": 403.4}, {"text": "Look.", "start": 403.7, "end": 404.34}, {"text": "Here come the bridesmaids.", "start": 404.34, "end": 405.96}, {"text": "Their dresses look beautiful.", "start": 406.18, "end": 407.98}, {"text": "Who are those kids walking down the aisle?", "start": 408.84000000000003, "end": 412.04}, {"text": "That's the flower girl and the ring bearer.", "start": 412.28, "end": 415.84}, {"text": "I'm pretty sure they're the groom's niece and nephew.", "start": 416.0, "end": 419.56}, {"text": "Oh, they look so cute.", "start": 419.92, "end": 422.36}, {"text": "I just hope the priest makes it quick.", "start": 424.0, "end": 426.7}, {"text": "I'm starving.", "start": 427.08, "end": 428.12}, {"text": "I hope the food's good at the reception.", "start": 428.52, "end": 430.5}, {"text": "That's all you ever think about.", "start": 430.84, "end": 433.32}, {"text": "Food.", "start": 433.5, "end": 433.96}, {"text": "Oh, I think the bride's coming now.", "start": 434.3, "end": 437.12}, {"text": "She looks gorgeous.", "start": 437.4, "end": 439.44}, {"text": "Wait.", "start": 440.42, "end": 441.14}, {"text": "What's she doing?", "start": 441.5, "end": 442.76}, {"text": "Where's she going?", "start": 443.36, "end": 444.66}, {"text": "Oh, great.", "start": 445.32, "end": 446.7}, {"text": "Does this mean that the reception is canceled?", "start": 447.2, "end": 449.82}, {"text": "Now, in this dialogue, we have a word that many students often make mistakes on.", "start": 453.04, "end": 459.4}, {"text": "So, this is a word that causes a lot of problems.", "start": 459.58, "end": 462.58}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 463.06, "end": 463.62}, {"text": "The word marry.", "start": 463.96, "end": 465.46}, {"text": "Marry.", "start": 465.84, "end": 466.48}, {"text": "Marry, right?", "start": 466.68, "end": 467.44}, {"text": "So, we are going to listen now to some common mistakes on how English learners use this word.", "start": 467.82, "end": 475.44}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 475.6, "end": 475.9}, {"text": "So, these are wrong examples.", "start": 475.98, "end": 478.2}, {"text": "These are great examples of mistakes students make with the word marry.", "start": 495.72, "end": 502.04}, {"text": "They're missing a word.", "start": 502.04, "end": 504.28}, {"text": "Let's listen to these right examples to see what word is missing.", "start": 504.7, "end": 509.86}, {"text": "Example 1", "start": 510.68, "end": 511.86}, {"text": "Honey, let's get married.", "start": 514.3000000000001, "end": 516.32}, {"text": "Example 2", "start": 519.94, "end": 521.1}, {"text": "We got married four years ago.", "start": 523.4200000000001, "end": 525.7}, {"text": "Example 3", "start": 528.7800000000001, "end": 530.0}, {"text": "When I get married, I want a huge wedding.", "start": 532.7800000000001, "end": 535.58}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 538.36, "end": 538.92}, {"text": "So, we can see that when we use the word marry, we say to get married.", "start": 539.14, "end": 544.62}, {"text": "Exactly right.", "start": 544.88, "end": 545.54}, {"text": "Get married.", "start": 545.84, "end": 546.68}, {"text": "To get married, right?", "start": 546.92, "end": 548.06}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 548.24, "end": 548.48}, {"text": "Don't forget that.", "start": 548.6, "end": 549.36}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 549.56, "end": 549.8}, {"text": "Get married.", "start": 550.02, "end": 550.86}, {"text": "I will get married.", "start": 551.06, "end": 552.44}, {"text": "We got married.", "start": 552.66, "end": 553.76}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 554.04, "end": 554.32}, {"text": "So, now you know exactly how to use this word.", "start": 554.32, "end": 557.94}, {"text": "We are ready to listen to our dialogue again for a third time.", "start": 558.32, "end": 562.06}, {"text": "And this time, it's going to be at a normal speed.", "start": 562.38, "end": 565.34}, {"text": "I can't believe that Anthony is finally getting married.", "start": 569.76, "end": 572.4}, {"text": "Yeah, well, it's about time.", "start": 572.74, "end": 574.02}, {"text": "He's been living with his parents for 40 years.", "start": 574.22, "end": 576.22}, {"text": "Don't be mean.", "start": 576.4, "end": 577.38}, {"text": "Look, here come the bridesmaids.", "start": 578.78, "end": 580.32}, {"text": "Oh, their dresses look beautiful.", "start": 580.44, "end": 581.96}, {"text": "Who are those kids walking down the aisle?", "start": 582.52, "end": 584.12}, {"text": "That's the flower girl and the rain bearer.", "start": 584.38, "end": 586.68}, {"text": "I'm pretty sure that they're the groom's niece and nephew.", "start": 586.68, "end": 589.24}, {"text": "Oh, they look so cute.", "start": 589.46, "end": 591.08}, {"text": "I just hope the priest makes it quick.", "start": 591.46, "end": 593.14}, {"text": "I'm starving.", "start": 593.3, "end": 593.92}, {"text": "I hope the food's good at the reception.", "start": 594.26, "end": 595.9}, {"text": "That's all you ever think about.", "start": 596.34, "end": 597.86}, {"text": "Food.", "start": 598.0, "end": 598.44}, {"text": "Oh, I think the bride's coming now.", "start": 599.58, "end": 601.34}, {"text": "Oh, she looks gorgeous.", "start": 601.52, "end": 602.84}, {"text": "Wait, what's she doing?", "start": 605.8999999999999, "end": 607.12}, {"text": "Where is she going?", "start": 607.42, "end": 608.42}, {"text": "So great.", "start": 608.74, "end": 609.66}, {"text": "Does this mean that the reception is canceled?", "start": 610.16, "end": 611.66}, {"text": "Okay, well, I'm going to be honest with you.", "start": 615.5999999999999, "end": 617.68}, {"text": "I don't know too much about marriages because, first of all, I'm not married.", "start": 617.74, "end": 621.84}, {"text": "And I've never really been to many marriages.", "start": 622.3999999999999, "end": 625.88}, {"text": "So, Erica, some questions for you.", "start": 626.14, "end": 628.12}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 628.22, "end": 628.48}, {"text": "What are these bridesmaids doing?", "start": 628.88, "end": 630.58}, {"text": "I mean, what are they about?", "start": 630.62, "end": 631.86}, {"text": "What do the bridesmaids do?", "start": 632.22, "end": 633.36}, {"text": "Yeah, what are they doing there?", "start": 633.46, "end": 634.96}, {"text": "Well, like I said earlier, the bridesmaids are the friends of the bride.", "start": 635.12, "end": 639.5}, {"text": "But the most important people, besides the bride and groom, are the best man and the maid of honor.", "start": 639.5, "end": 648.3}, {"text": "Okay, and what do they do there in the ceremony?", "start": 648.58, "end": 650.84}, {"text": "Well, what they do is they sign the marriage license.", "start": 651.12, "end": 655.36}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 655.72, "end": 656.2}, {"text": "So, they're like witnesses.", "start": 656.4, "end": 657.94}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 658.4, "end": 658.84}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 659.3, "end": 659.54}, {"text": "So, but wait a minute.", "start": 659.78, "end": 660.78}, {"text": "They sign the marriage license there in the church?", "start": 660.94, "end": 663.9}, {"text": "Yeah, of course.", "start": 664.1, "end": 664.8}, {"text": "Right inside the church, you sign the marriage license.", "start": 664.8, "end": 667.24}, {"text": "Wow, that's strange.", "start": 667.46, "end": 668.26}, {"text": "Because, from what I know, in other countries, usually you will sign the marriage license before the ceremony.", "start": 668.26, "end": 675.28}, {"text": "So, you get married twice.", "start": 675.84, "end": 677.5}, {"text": "Yeah, you have like the civil marriage and then you have like the church wedding or whatever.", "start": 677.88, "end": 682.36}, {"text": "That's so complicated.", "start": 682.4, "end": 683.36}, {"text": "Well, yeah, I mean, the church wedding is just a ceremony.", "start": 684.04, "end": 687.26}, {"text": "It's not really anything official.", "start": 687.26, "end": 689.04}, {"text": "Oh, in Canada, it's the official part as well.", "start": 689.38, "end": 691.74}, {"text": "I guess maybe you're just more efficient.", "start": 691.84, "end": 693.16}, {"text": "Maybe.", "start": 693.44, "end": 693.8}, {"text": "Well, this is a really fascinating, a really interesting subject, isn't it?", "start": 694.5799999999999, "end": 699.16}, {"text": "Yeah, because there's so many countries that have different marriage ceremonies.", "start": 699.4, "end": 703.32}, {"text": "I know that marriages in India last around seven days.", "start": 703.5, "end": 706.14}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah.", "start": 706.44, "end": 707.08}, {"text": "I want to know more about how our users get married in their country.", "start": 707.08, "end": 711.6}, {"text": "Yeah, so please go to our website at EnglishPod.com and tell us how you get married in your countries.", "start": 711.9, "end": 718.68}, {"text": "Yeah, I can't wait to hear your stories.", "start": 718.68, "end": 721.36}, {"text": "Yeah, it should be interesting, right?", "start": 721.6, "end": 722.78}, {"text": "Okay, well, everyone, thanks for listening and until next time, goodbye.", "start": 723.28, "end": 727.78}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 727.78, "end": 728.18}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 728.18, "end": 728.36}]